Cell["\<\
The two layers have opposite moments. The 6 by 6 matrix below is the onsite \
block of the z=0 layer, with rows and columns ordered as \
{pxup,pxdn,pyup,pydn,pzup,pzdn}:\
\>", "TechNoteText",ExpressionUUID->"d29c4f77-49bf-4afb-8f0e-af65b42f4f0d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

